{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06U0", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ff388dff62d436b3aa0cb4bce1371d91d942cb325a1e5042698141a43bf41693", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThus we may use the following natural definition.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:35322e4680cc43900423677afa805c977a7e233dfb5b517fe59270b0a952b65f", "unit_id": "tag:06U0:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "06U0", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$|\\mathcal{X}| \\to |\\mathcal{Y}|$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0006": "$$\n|\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}| \\to |\\mathcal{Z}|\n$$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-open}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d845ac48dbe05d1bf1c8ff6f460f854508cff0972f32d3df8853c4d19c24ab27", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6651c6388ac9003e0efb80adb38c50589f9bf58ea2949ab3598974f60ed43ebe", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> We say <MATH_0002> is <TEXTITOPEN_0001>open<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if the map of topological\nspaces <MATH_0003> is open.\n<STRUCT_0003> We say <MATH_0004> is <TEXTITOPEN_0002>universally open<TEXTITCLOSE_0002> if for every morphism\nof algebraic stacks <MATH_0005>\nthe morphism of topological spaces\n<MATH_0006>\nis open, i.e., the base change\n<MATH_0007> is open.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c664b32481457d3ac3b23534354b6586f97639c1dcd2168f5e8635c79b1ed0bf", "unit_id": "tag:06U2:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06U0", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-universally-open}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:423d783f7e69a579a81183648081f9cc41e56649e5d546ac21ff74c18a8d2607", "source_text": "The base change of a universally open morphism of algebraic stacks\nby any morphism of algebraic stacks is universally open.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c95cdaa99ecd5180e31476c418af033ad47a75c2100fd61fda85f056665f6cd5", "unit_id": "tag:06U3:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06U0", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a7a25742d85098d541735c748ff43a599546cc6f101ba177890bb1a9f6e18bac", "source_text": "This is immediate from the definition.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ed527da30f69c9bcc90112222bdf3d207c927d6febb801818b673598175ce475", "unit_id": "tag:06U3:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06U0", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-universally-open}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5fd2930286423e4fcfe8724d2fc580679e3ab9eddca2c5b48fc3b8febe57ecb2", "source_text": "The composition of a pair of (universally) open morphisms of\nalgebraic stacks is (universally) open.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:15c6423f7644e2e81ab6d458bd3aff7b1ab9c0315f27c968fa560432f6eabff4", "unit_id": "tag:06U4:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06U0", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a7a25742d85098d541735c748ff43a599546cc6f101ba177890bb1a9f6e18bac", "source_text": "Omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:872a8cfa74892c6e6464bd864d9f1c292f4f523caba3e51ac3dafbfc84db48f6", "unit_id": "tag:06U4:proof"}
